style and abilities. From assassin, to berserker, to arcanist, choose the vampire that best suits your preferred method of hunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/809090/extras/3d44400994f453486d0b2e9bf6245242.poster.avif?t=1754049945\" width=600 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/809090/extras/3d44400994f453486d0b2e9bf6245242.webm?t=1754049945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Your Own Legend </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your perfect vampire warrior by enhancing their strengths and shoring up their weaknesses with a diverse array of powerful artifacts. Mold your character to fit your preferred style of combat and dominate the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arm Yourself For Battle </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself with an arsenal of deadly weapons, from modern firearms to ancient relics of the night. Whether you favor the rapid-fire chaos of an SMG or the elegant precision of a revolver, the choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harness Unholy Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take customization to the next level by modding your weapons with an extensive selection of upgrades. From explosive rounds to vampiric life-steal, tailor your arsenal to suit your preferred method of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/809090/extras/8a6bec390eac4c82c54b3a851868c25a.poster.avif?t=1754049945\" width=600 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/809090/extras/8